# MTT q79 Height-Four A404 Projective Period Transitions (A410) v1

A410 instantiates the exact A123 triangular five-period transition at all 40 native-z A404 entries. Both directions are serialized as interval matrices; every overlap has `ell_1 ell_2 != 0`, every transition contains the exact determinant `-1`, and both inverse products contain the identity.

The minimum determinant absolute lower bound is `1`. Outer-leg values and A405 operator application remain separate gates.
